{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_011ami0134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_011ami0134_1000_011ami", "source_sha256": "8616acdeb5c2dae85b2d5103f4a28e778f0640266732688b76db490013d54954", "ja": "やあ、兄ちゃん。……じゃなくて、兄さん。\n今日もステキな一日だね。", "zh": "嗨，哥。……不对，是兄长。\n今天也是美好的一天呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_011ami0134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_011ami0134_1001_p", "source_sha256": "4de96bc52058864d723dcf294233c6caa3af59d59cffb4d0b8b432ca29006b98", "ja": "……亜美、何なんだその話し方は。\nまあ、大体想像がつくけど。", "zh": "……亚美，你这说话方式是怎么回事啊。\n不过，我大概也能猜得到就是了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_011ami0134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_011ami0134_1002_011ami", "source_sha256": "3527fd62a344877f33cc0e852e71b8877fa9f0a95e7f53b333fde4d68e99e2ee", "ja": "はっはっは、兄さんは面白いことを言うね。\nボクのココロが読めるとでも言うのかい？", "zh": "哈哈哈，哥哥真会说有趣的话呢。你该不会以为自己能读懂我的心吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_011ami0134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_011ami0134_1003_p", "source_sha256": "1c8694ad09719fa263aaa3c3cc82577b133d88dbbb48bb58e7b2dfdc1736517a", "ja": "心は読めないけど……でも、カッコいい衣装を\nもらったから、イケメンごっこをしてるんだろ？", "zh": "读心是读不出来……不过，你是因为拿到了\n帅气的服装，才在玩帅哥扮演游戏吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_011ami0134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_011ami0134_1004_011ami", "source_sha256": "93a2379c3a1dc4259687193cf02dfd0c1804ff95a73223638df97977105f8658", "ja": "ぎくっ！", "zh": "你、你说什么！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_011ami0134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_011ami0134_1005_011ami", "source_sha256": "64c0b9cc06d6105c75d08bf03293e879519df59321045c7f53b313ffdee12e43", "ja": "は……はっはっはっは、面白いよ兄さん。\n腕を上げたな、褒めてツカワそう。", "zh": "哈……哈哈哈哈，有意思啊，哥哥。你进步了嘛，就赏你一句夸奖吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_011ami0134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_011ami0134_1006_p", "source_sha256": "d0c140792cb0c4df95836edbcf44427539b4ec985ea417706a5a648d8767d6a9", "ja": "ラスボスと殿様が混じってるぞ。……とにかく、\nその衣装を気に入ってくれたってことなんだな？", "zh": "最终BOSS和大老爷混在一起了啊。……总之，也就是说，你很喜欢那套服装，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_011ami0134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_011ami0134_1007_011ami", "source_sha256": "784f8b48aa43aa50edc93af815fd39e194d0545fa0f54dc9c6ebadde25db0b63", "ja": "はっはっは、その通りだよ兄さん。この素晴らしい\n衣装のおかげで、素晴らしいボクの気分は素晴らしい。", "zh": "哈哈哈，说得没错，哥哥。这身棒极了的服装，让棒极了的我心情也棒极了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_011ami0134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_011ami0134_1008_p", "source_sha256": "394610986ed9597c09465be394bf37aac70b6385fffe32bf255ff8eacc93615b", "ja": "まだ続けるのか……。\nじゃあ、このショートケーキはいらないかな？", "zh": "还要继续吗……  \n那这个草莓蛋糕，你不要了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_011ami0134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_011ami0134_1009_011ami", "source_sha256": "f3f0df7d8e6269633a7e08d6de23e64081888525798543c529253a986f994077", "ja": "え、ケーキ！？\nいるに決まって……るじゃないか兄さん！", "zh": "咦，蛋糕！？  \n当然要……不对，哥哥！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_011ami0134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_011ami0134_1010_p", "source_sha256": "aaf90fec28dd039407b44c51132d2f398d2e98602070a779f33878eb92266c5c", "ja": "でも、イケメンにケーキは似合わないし。\n2個買ってきたけど、どっちも真美にあげるとするか。", "zh": "不过，蛋糕不适合帅哥嘛。既然买了2个，那就把这两个都给真美好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_011ami0134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_011ami0134_1011_011ami", "source_sha256": "894662ae59137d00ec7687c317ac477dd96521893ccd8f6cdc1e664dbda9ad71", "ja": "うあうあ！　真美をヒイキするなんてズルっこだよー！\n兄ちゃんのいじめっ子！　女泣かせ！　うわーん！", "zh": "呜哇呜哇！偏心真美，太狡猾了——！\n哥哥是个坏蛋！专门欺负女孩子！呜哇——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_011ami0134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_011ami0134_1012_p", "source_sha256": "ad14ff8f15a2d92f35bba6cc437d16292adf1145855410ceea5403f60c58dbbd", "ja": "戻った途端に人聞きの悪いことを……！\nほら、1個あげるから落ち着きなさい。", "zh": "刚回来就说些让人误会的话……！\n来，我给你1个，先冷静一下。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_011ami0134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_011ami0134_1013_011ami", "source_sha256": "2c712f6c24ecef06335c66f8821082cb3ac896021d7c3f917bff482a1ffa53fe", "ja": "わーい！　ありがと兄ちゃん♪\nケーキもイケメン衣装も、亜美メッチャうれしいよ！", "zh": "哇——！谢谢哥哥♪  \n蛋糕和帅哥服装，亚美都超级开心哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_011ami0134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_011ami0134_1014_p", "source_sha256": "799ba165c0f0872fd51bd216ef55da709626b73411d37eac37e3977462d3b117", "ja": "そうかそうか。はは、素直にそう言ってもらえると、\nこっちも嬉しくなっちゃうな。", "zh": "是吗是吗。哈哈，你能这么直率地说出来，我这边也会忍不住高兴起来啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_011ami0134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_011ami0134_1015_011ami", "source_sha256": "6829b631f5c1e2136e553ea199d6f14cf21786fe0d1610974334423947ea1c27", "ja": "そう？　じゃあ、もっと言ったげるね！\nよっ、兄ちゃんイケメン！　サイコー！　女たらし！", "zh": "是吗？那我再多夸几句给你听！  \n哟，哥哥是个大帅哥！最棒了！花花公子！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_011ami0134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_011ami0134_1016_p", "source_sha256": "66dc6acba407eac64f880eb0c1a4623f548ef87d8c2310a88c3274c097afb3ae", "ja": "最後のはダメだ！\nそれ以上ふざけるなら、ケーキ返してもらうぞ？", "zh": "最后那个不行！\n再闹下去的话，蛋糕给我还回来？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_011ami0134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_011ami0134_1017_011ami", "source_sha256": "10e76880eb3ff5464aa257d1315257510a6d2731703ea37280e10f2d0de3e830", "ja": "んっふっふ～♪　兄ちゃん甘いよ。ケーキより甘いよ。\n亜美が、もらったものを返すと思ったら大間違いだよ！", "zh": "嗯呼呼～♪　老哥你太天真啦。比蛋糕还要甜哦。\n你要是以为亚美会把拿到手的东西还回去，那就大错特错啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_011ami0134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_011ami0134_1018_011ami", "source_sha256": "024f4bce6856be717b4ae060ce40e1bad4392b85c64ecdf31a959052a5fde715", "ja": "ついでに、もらった分で満足するハズもないのだよ！\nケーキはハコごといただいたー！　さらばだー！", "zh": "而且，才不会满足于收到的那份呢！  \n蛋糕连盒子一起拿走啦——！拜拜啦——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_011ami0134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_011ami0134_1019_p", "source_sha256": "6e7beeb39ffa38d62a6b720607e2d0fc6affa8ee0b2eeb704775c5cc7cb50473", "ja": "はっ、いつのまに！？\nこら亜美、待て！　待ちなさーい！", "zh": "哈，什么时候！？\n喂，亚美，等等！给我站住——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
